2026-06-28 00:36:22,102 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: To address the client's expectations for an AI assistance solution that provides explainable recommendations or suggestions, supports medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A), and facilitates collaboration and continuity of care, we can leverage our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. 

Our RAG approach allows us to generate answers grounded in the client's controlled corpus, which includes their internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. This core capability aligns with the requirement for explainable recommendations since every answer can cite passages from the retrieved documents, ensuring transparency and traceability.

